<title>PHILIPPINES: ICTSI says to fight SBMA port decision.</title>
<headline>ICTSI says to fight SBMA port decision.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1996-09-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>International Container Terminal Services Inc (ICTSI) said on Tuesday it will fight Subic Bay Development Authority's (SBMA) decision awarding a port privatisation contract to a unit of Hong Kong's Hutchison Whampoa Ltd.</p>
<p>&quot;We'll get a fairer hearing in Malacanang (the presidential palace) rather than the SBMA,&quot; ICTSI chairman Enrique Razon told Reuters.</p>
</text>
